<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Case Study</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">ACToR</span> outperformed coverage baseline on 55/57 programs in the macro benchmark, while failing on one program name ‘pr‘. We further analyze the reason behind this failure.
The correctness gap is caused by the corner difference between the environment where we run <span id="A1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text">ACToR</span> and the validation environment when we test the translation, due to an imperfect testing harness.
The translator agent claims that all tests were passed during the translation procedure, but actually got timeouts on most cases during validation.
After manually adjusting the code (1 line edit) to adapt to the validation environment, the translation achieves an <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="84\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>84</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">84\%</annotation></semantics></math> relative pass rate, higher than the coverage baseline.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F5" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.F5.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="52.3" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 52.3" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,52.3) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 6.6 L 0 45.7 C 0 49.34 2.95 52.3 6.6 52.3 L 543.4 52.3 C 547.05 52.3 550 49.34 550 45.7 L 550 6.6 C 550 2.95 547.05 0 543.4 0 L 6.6 0 C 2.95 0 0 2.95 0 6.6 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 6.6 L 0.69 29.2 L 549.31 29.2 L 549.31 6.6 C 549.31 3.34 546.66 0.69 543.4 0.69 L 6.6 0.69 C 3.34 0.69 0.69 3.34 0.69 6.6 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 16.44 37.29)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:32.5em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="449.71"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
